EASIEST WAY (no confusion)
 Method 1: Check inside Jenkins UI
Open Jenkins (your 9090 one)
Go to: Manage Jenkins
Click: System Information

 Now look for:

os.name
✔ If you see:
Windows 10 →  Jenkins is on Windows
Linux →  Jenkins is on Linux/Ubuntu
 Method 2: Check workspace path

Go to:
Manage Jenkins → System Information

Look for:

user.dir or workspace
✔ If path looks like:
C:\Users\... → Windows
/home/... → Linux
